s you engaged and motivated to build and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>STUNNING COLORFUL GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually captivating world where rich and vibrant colours bring every detail to life. House Builder 2 offers a feast for the eyes, from lush landscapes to intricate interiors, making every building project feel unique and beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the adventure of a lifetime in House Builder 2. Whether you're an experienced architect or a novice builder, there's something for everyone here. Grab your tools and start building your dream home today!</p>","developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827960/1e1345b87821ce5ed8dcd70cd25eeedd8753e809/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1759405238","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827960/200912433/591c904ce08750ff0be2bca9082cb4936dc062b3/1757934820/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757936532","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827960/200912433/591c904ce08750ff0be2bca9082cb4936dc062b3/1757934820/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757936532","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827960/200912433/591c904ce08750ff0be2bca9082cb4936dc062b3/1757934820/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757936532","id":257197967,"mp4":{"480":"https://video